{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">內地股市回穩，終止過去三日跌勢。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">四大指數先跌後反彈，升幅不足百分之1。滬深京三市成交不足1.5萬億元人民幣。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">房地產和電池板塊上升。煤炭和航運股則下跌。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-29T09:19:22.414279+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":77,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}